{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1578,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbcfb4243c9029aaeaab712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈，哎呀算漏了，正赛的状态\n居然这么烂！――太糟了……\n但也只能硬着头皮上了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43f3881f57d307eaecc2d6a64b0102d8041a15af53e17143fa1761d2b8530e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11bcc03e1d128f811f24bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "………………哈？\r\n我才没有……我状态好得很……\r\n落子绝不会有一丝犹豫……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad4fe9a8b775610d301f4c1638423e9c31e99e819d7252cedb62b3f542779a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1998adf78f804d1c238191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a8923031e7d82e73e7fcbae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的回合！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b54a8a880cdaf223c732f6564c3e721206715cbf8417cf37b05f0e1350718cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7360ad5ed64c97e1eca44d2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c27b671abd96656d55c23c4947eec0a2ed3d25244933af767d238e5f01c465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06be1c631522beb2da0a28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小菜一碟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a071378b87789fc619e4061ae44a1920948d8acd4b8fd629ba0c197ff9b422d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87804bd5cbfe561e13676024",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "死局了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "345038d883a8a812323c6785f4530fdb90466c064db865df8c4b0a7bc2a54ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dec0146c56109a6632114c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认输投降～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1086bca977c06672e120e81532861bff3d815e795ac1d4da424b9632ad4c22b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61117bb9f0ea12b6d1bf2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上啦～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae87a7cd150ccd6c05164da25831f754488189abb87b92fb31381c4b4c039747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffe38c6e926b18c2ec470323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，至少姿态是优美的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ca403466a5c50b62245e9dd1995c83a2a0f19353222e218aa663dc330586c92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56595623874d205ca49d374c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向我的左右手的奉献致敬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f683639cf86bef50c3da6e8aa240fcb1e505bb786f91f5205b1e22b1a0402ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1a1a306068d3e83cb6c084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场不错的游戏呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e29cb9714875cec54786245ee612fe2abb9624ad7ad5e65f14f99436ab52040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6e05f39f4b6e020d46a3d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Game Start――",
      "source_fingerprint": "19fffe9cce1130753a18f471a70111d653778b76ca64223a3da138336d4dede5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436926f9449ce9fc78acf440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用最佳着法拿下胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3e0fc10da02f00fb50aec7f9bb2af7f31f1f954907e08756c48a875a55a8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3cfadabb2771c43358dd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，来对局一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "773ecd63b1694007765b4f6f95bf369b2ccffa349f5936bae40f7a3543a2b8cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1f02e90386527b413c1b9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场不错的游戏呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e29cb9714875cec54786245ee612fe2abb9624ad7ad5e65f14f99436ab52040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94dbd7a19165aa0b61224920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盘面已经一清二楚了――\r\n接下来直到将死为止，\r\n行云流水地下完即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86e1a7c24199e451ef51a8dbf8c8962d7a2d9fc9295b944a4ab20df2969b106",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb85398f3f4c061fc6474e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经看到致胜序列了。\r\n剩下的就是付诸行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb52e38f8944b3178d10b4bb31bd3f6a2cd186f6f399fecd279d4d2f4a4935c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adece4e35890777fc810890c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场不错的游戏呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e29cb9714875cec54786245ee612fe2abb9624ad7ad5e65f14f99436ab52040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04be75378ef9d0d5b4447bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a539ee9bb3d0fe804ff38c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就差最后一步了啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9806ac415b4edfcb5d0ec9606f46dafd604e5ec86273ea0cfc14671eeafc4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a12dcdb4dadbd736d0d8c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整一下战略吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "966a1099e4150773afe0da9a04dcdfe6e536fd1052f12845f3998f84426e57eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7f0e987e11ce426abe9f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "区区一局而已，动摇不了我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8922936ec6eaaf72c22e8434896c29a319672ae3bbcbc3a0e88d956b2b4b8278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c398d4e7b6801b906443d7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "死局了～～！！为什么啊～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1f213af09b2eb92c8b3bd19df55e7eeae0cc5f36afc3d9f0f43ec3d7935287",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49902d7d4391b3a97c710570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，这盘面很优美吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d3308e138d47e85784901b4aeeeb6888721d41b939cd11cd56ff1d3f6adeaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd865462ac42e8622faa715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场胜负，在开始之前就已经结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f42935846dfb4f162d1e589afcc04819a1e7e103e6dde262285466563a4183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c149b1f93e0305e6ce1899d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来切磋一局吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2adb9e152c9d007b7b8f86492e20a8f3fd4beb1cf40befbca2533cbc173b4db4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c6ac68fab999feb8862a60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就在这里将死你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8065879fc3003043c0c2ca6aab08c9805789c7ab0ce193c72bcc024675a81ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceef2eb4d533391d05db20c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盘面已被我掌控……你们的思路全在我的预料之中。\r\n那么――将军。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4d5016d01f64d6542d3bb365643d41c7b8d828f3f5b959d25cf8a995b117f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2714ce6b12db1f6435160f8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的英姿，你就尽情烙印在眼底吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e2aabf4828fd86c2aa1a792e2d480aa0831b0877a2dbf403a14f15b4fdd2009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433a8cee903bea364c9429fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优胜演出亦是一处战场……看我完全掌控它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c23df39d233ae3658f5ed44eeedcc8d462c0ad08f2ff521ceda302f1681d9b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99327acc60cb9a1ca9cb77f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同来支配吧，这个名为世界的棋盘――",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab913961ca0728b6cd106ff772d01430bb6cfcb70751cd67b57701fb9009e88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e383c4a37777ac687b62351",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能成为学院的训练员，\r\n对我来说真是莫大的幸运……\r\n托你的福，我似乎能好好享受这场游戏了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d1f1231bc63b7d7714951d87d17880991a49f7f8ed683544654d4f18886bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec46c89e10ab2404debcc7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校服不用花时间挑选搭配，时间性价比很高",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba28da8505142b56e40a9d018f8f45fef03b58108d3b8d0fc7bd3d4447c5205b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a390072b1f1a8266cc8fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统一制式的服装，穿搭品味可是关键呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9064b7ea2364c8884675027ef693e9891e6713b92085c400244d7801b11a7cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acba0be7524439918ec8d977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手套质感上乘，戴着玩游戏也没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a436f2e9f81d294375c43a4eeb1e6151da8efc7f7084862c68699f1b527f90b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbde1362e56b832e278d8697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想干脆穿着睡衣去上课……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92308b0996aa44a4d93b79d422422a1570c2f40aeee28d4676381363086ac19d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bcd5701c2a1ec8fea95eae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞要是当作游戏来看，倒也过得去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e043271966fe939ee3210abaf2c5532da8fd7252e50b160878eb1b10ef6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa897067857e4197443ffd04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，也想在我的掌心起舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13ee8b12650f7362d938f0741121efab31ec78c09e514e2e300c02397b72899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61934d3206fba8592611cd47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到衣服，穿起来舒不舒服才是最重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ff36e884f887f2a56ccc91f133d550689575b3a63d30708bf8e6db721666ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a876149dc94f1578e42d83a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更衣所耗费的精力自然是越少越好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78cc0ea2def4a3747bef2c03c6d88445b944591aa57d6881039a1559b8fd4daf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1237996c659241d8250cb9f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很中意这种洗练深邃的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecb63b78133e63c75345289f2e48a458832fad32aa91642015b0f152235892c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e896cd82c5930e423fc7937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能直接穿着放松休闲的随性感才是精髓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6edb034a9076906f6c8af30a8e22429334f1fd7dabd572182fe17f0f83f6701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffd4c5f15e2afbb2cdd7d85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校服不用花时间挑选搭配，时间性价比很高",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba28da8505142b56e40a9d018f8f45fef03b58108d3b8d0fc7bd3d4447c5205b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d468187fbd7cf6a85a64bce6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统一制式的服装，穿搭品味可是关键呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9064b7ea2364c8884675027ef693e9891e6713b92085c400244d7801b11a7cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9777b1266c962308444aac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手套质感上乘，戴着玩游戏也没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a436f2e9f81d294375c43a4eeb1e6151da8efc7f7084862c68699f1b527f90b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c8220e3ee063521b3884dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想干脆穿着睡衣去上课……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92308b0996aa44a4d93b79d422422a1570c2f40aeee28d4676381363086ac19d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fef2035dcfd450ab79cea58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞要是当作游戏来看，倒也过得去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e043271966fe939ee3210abaf2c5532da8fd7252e50b160878eb1b10ef6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f725acc6652ade3d054a17de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，也想在我的掌心起舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13ee8b12650f7362d938f0741121efab31ec78c09e514e2e300c02397b72899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bd6714708726d09f5c090d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到衣服，穿起来舒不舒服才是最重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ff36e884f887f2a56ccc91f133d550689575b3a63d30708bf8e6db721666ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13031e8f8f1ea9c4e414b39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更衣所耗费的精力自然是越少越好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78cc0ea2def4a3747bef2c03c6d88445b944591aa57d6881039a1559b8fd4daf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c8061375dbe545f81f394e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a92e8a4bfca3e326a6d7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红茶、咖啡，我都喝……\r\n不过早晨还是偏爱港式奶茶啊。\r\n推演思路的清晰度完全不一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f4a6d19397eb103dd0063254aa1d119df9b29358a08f2e6b7d21e9336176de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce836aec5e9b8fe1107804b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肾上腺素在不断激涌……\r\n状态简直嗨到不行……！――不，\r\n并不是睡得好。而是通宵了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f564cc21461aed0024064884e018c7e27d76504c454adfd0f933d57d4325d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b70cfd318f35e6941ae013f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分析名人的对局棋谱时\r\n有了很有趣的发现。啊，上课\r\n什么的无所谓，研究这个有意义得多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936d99672d197e95199cf0234d179dcea06016fee9c9f6fb36096d388e91d7fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a37e2a44b9ee7898060203b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息是关乎玩家士气的\r\n重大事宜。你也明白的吧。\r\n――那我能直接回家了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "347958695046e30dccd69d763887971f89e28d2ccb9fb6a8855e14bfa80e8c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c43ba72ade4bcbbee3bd4cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的宁静真好。既不会打扰长考，\n预读推演也能磨砺得更敏锐……\n最适合玩桌游了。这就是我是个夜猫子的原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9493a4b96320da31bca7d0feeb08e597b2397098e720ba8e5b665d02dd234295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734a545860b2599ea471aed5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍门禁嘛……好歹有在遵守……\n要是晚了，神威会担心得不得了\n吵吵嚷嚷的可麻烦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7f3fdd396241405589779010b6e00b78f1500a9352055df8cf912dfc39ccbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943965650517c0b7a8cebc0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很同情这个时节的自然界啊。\r\n被迫发芽，被迫飞向外界。\r\n宛如弃子一般可悲呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "336c8090621ce7a9295c139a1bc4f2f70337791910ca0f5a6ca678704783a85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150d58fe63e539ad9015c1b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫外线、中暑、脱水……有个能防止\r\n所有死局的究极秘策――\r\n穴熊围，也就是闭门不出室内派！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e327cf66cb3a7674a3f540869c896278e6d54d9c9379f9c61f9acbe32957ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710dc598b43ee879deb72b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家每年都会例行去温泉旅馆赏红叶。\r\n风雅的庭园真是……\r\n呃不，一直在玩桌游完全没印象了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdfbdb8d3cf247818e55d21bf8011d2f154294c672cbe383e07658acc2f13710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2049bb6bc540d2d38f793a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天果然还是甜食最好吃啊。\r\n冰淇淋、巧克力……根据地的\r\n冰箱果然还是太小了啊……换个大的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "380a4b1c39fc5d7d965e1cd22678e2807556897dd0822b5ac19b9bf59e982a00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc9da86f967592ce77b21f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7158b79125613d724fac5e21a37ea5b96ec1a17e66423d4a70e9e96acbc5d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247b25587640f779dfb43cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玫瑰在国际象棋上的造诣相当深厚哦。\r\n虽然她谦虚地说是“略懂一二”……\r\n但那绝对是在虚张声势虚晃一枪呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a693c2ab64978d3467240fb98e096c75c4605a80fdd8bbe209a74ef43b12e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af7fa83b152af46ab73943e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比萨这家伙……明明长了张天使般的脸，\r\n抽卡运简直离谱得要命……！\r\n不对，正因为是天使所以才运气爆棚吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c9c08d084c185ab51863c4a50821b2a63ba1625000d489e0fc468914f6b7ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9444e560bf26ef4aecf36165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "父母从小就很尊重我的兴趣。\r\n特意给我建了个用来玩齿轮墙的\r\n房间时，我还真吃了一惊呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee40500587030ddbea9bd0d933de0f95cafac77bf4cfbd919c1f280fa4e3c1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac61965dc412455eda78518d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从现在起禁止说外来语词汇。我来\n带你练习词语类桌游。……刚才\n还没开始，所以不算犯规哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55052d8b9a379158cf0f17efb172025db2bf5043ed0aaed69646fa0653e113b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c988d897aa17b8351f56c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出门前的准备绝对是世界上\r\n最麻烦的事了……一边换衣服\r\n一边甚至都会冒出想回家的念头……",
      "source_fingerprint": "32cddd3b467e791d5455d3ee0b497111e08c3b1c9bad743e9bd12f272d964ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea17c06a9d55307649c642b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便身着同样的服饰，统治者的\n风度也是会自然流露出来的……\n正如国际象棋中的国王那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44682848181c21b3f63f0c492ae2202c14a52b9b6e27483b98bbd105bdcd6ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1043c661b258f3309caffb58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会亦是掌控人心的一处局面……\n将舞台与观众的心尽收囊中，\n拿下这一回合吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd38980ae5f20e3d52d29c529df52b1a3c7fe5cfadc699c0ea1863ebe2e96cbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f98c087b1b0775a42b5e89c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刻意削减色彩信息，\r\n彻底追求极致简约的造型之美……\r\n这就是黑白色调的绝妙之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eeb9eb1e3d8945979b61326ae830f96f85a791d06dd20820e69eed7fa523205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afd3e70da64bd4581b8ab5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然是以功能性优先……但与此同时\r\n时髦帅气也是不可或缺的。\r\n我可是非常讲究这之间的平衡的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9adaedd5fc752892c5661180f84d9d0fe3a2d692970330fb39d5a60ff0ac7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e3aca83d216c2776ad501d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊――好困……大清早的神威怎么\n那么有精神啊……大嗓门吵得我\n回笼觉都被糟蹋了不是吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff50fc012e3e8acae3f8c9b698841915db39c510f9382cc90681df25f4b6583d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d506a3f2caf5524d5dd2f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽发了一大堆LANE过来……\n午饭吃了吗，作业交了吗……\n全是唠叨！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc814cc00b3b1e64938d95096eaf150a23e33e58dfc7711ddbd751005097de36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbdb3bc52bbf40d0c76191c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天过得真是一瞬间啊……和比萨\n她们玩变则黑白棋玩得太热火朝天，\n时间简直光速蒸发了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d3f6c7bc8fcde611540857a31f39dc881b59b8cb849eac7e67c749387ed3b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac17eb60eb2d5115c613325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在众人都沉溺于春日融融的时节，\r\n正是趁虚而入打出缓手的好机会……开玩笑的。\r\n利用环境也是战略的一部分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef114436adf998529c4f3f0deacbfd7506b1092d18175d6f1d4e455e85d17bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2f8c698741285ec3a55eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔玩玩恐怖类桌游也不错呢。\r\n你也来陪我嘛，\r\n你总不会说自己害怕吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceaf14799a6777e3045fad270fa584071aa0389ef90a17ce3a1628f835f82b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01bf6580ea2787838d504b92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书之秋吗……心理学书籍也很有\r\n意思哦。你要不要也学习一下？\r\n说不定能让战术更加精进呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc3f2cae3e87c65736dc585dcb7e63b5907262e2aaff01049c856258f4bfbe12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737dc9c6f667533f07a42b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道我的根据地缺少什么了……\n是闪耀学姐亲手做的\n苹果派外卖系统……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a93081b79583c87c2ea286e52660653509e3c814be00dce8f02d8350fe01fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af0d85348099842d81bf46b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "战略没有漏洞吧？可别一不留神\r\n就变成了叠兵……\r\n必须无懈可击地把方案推演到极致。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a902d254ce0493e0edc8d7f6df5128b975045879faaa56fb6188470ea4a2adb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
